Develop a Food Order Management System using a Singly Linked List in C++. 
Each node represents a food order and stores the Order ID, Food Item, Quantity, 
and a pointer to the next order.

The system should allow the user to:

Add a new food order
Delete a completed/cancelled order
Search for an order using Order ID
Display all pending orders

The project demonstrates the use of dynamic memory allocation, pointers, 
linked-list insertion, deletion, searching, and traversal.
